{:semantic-analyzer/messages
 {;; Judge failures — a violation standing in for a judgement the judge did
  ;; not give. {detail} is the call's error, an answer excerpt, or the deadline.
  :judge/call-failed
  "The policy judge call failed, so this file was not judged: {detail}"

  :judge/unparseable
  "The policy judge's answer was not a list of findings, so this file was not judged: {detail}"

  :judge/deadline-exceeded
  "The policy judge reached its {detail} ms deadline before judging this file"}}
